              </a>
              <a href="/tools/profile-viewer/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-2.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-[#192538] dark:text-[#CBD5E1] hover:bg-[#FAF8F5] dark:hover:bg-[#1E2738] hover:text-[#3368A0] dark:hover:text-[#66A3BF] transition-colors">
                <span class="text-sm">🔍</span>
                <div>
