          <span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#3368A0] bg-[#FFFFFF] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-[8px] border border-[#C8DFDB] shadow-xs">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0D9488]"></span>
            Zero Server Uploads
